   "evidence": "Supercritical.lean:85-92: `theorem exists_bilin_comp_precompL ... \u2203 \u03a6 : (\u2102 \u2192L[\u211d] F) \u2192L[\u211d] V \u2192L[\u211d] (F \u2192L[\u211d] G) \u2192L[\u211d] \u2102 \u2192L[\u211d] H, \u2200 D v A, \u03a6 D v A = B.precompL \u2102 (A.comp D) v := \u27e8..., fun _ _ _ => rfl\u27e9`. The only callers are those two `obtain` sites, found by grep.",
